      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive veterinary care from clinic doctors"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently express deep trust in Dr. Birchler and the veterinary team, praising their dedication, extensive medical knowledge, and compassionate support during appointments. Many pet parents note long-standing family relationships with the clinic, though several reviewers report occasional friction with front desk receptionists."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 21,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling of cats and dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the gentle, loving approach shown to companion animals during routine vaccinations, exams, and illness checkups. Owners note that staff treat pets with warmth and patience, helping them stay relaxed in the examination rooms, though one visitor reported an extended wait for an unperformed feline intake exam."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Informative medical guidance from clinicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners appreciate that veterinarians spend dedicated time explaining diagnoses, preventive care schedules, and treatment recommendations during routine visits. However, a few reviewers report administrative communication friction, including long hold times on the phone and abrupt desk conversations."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the hospital have a cancellation fee policy?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients report that the clinic enforces a twenty-dollar cancellation policy for missed appointments or late cancellations."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can owners schedule appointments with a specific veterinarian?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients frequently request Dr. Birchler, though appointments may be assigned to other attending staff depending on daily scheduling."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does the clinic handle walk-in urgent cases?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic primarily operates by scheduled appointment, and reviewers advise calling ahead as unscheduled emergency visits may not always be accommodated immediately."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
